      "properties": {},
      "widgets_values": [
        "# Shorts - prompt or image to video (Wan 2.2 5B)\n\n**Output:** 704x1280 portrait, 121 frames, 24 fps (~5 s), silent.\n\n- To generate from a prompt only, leave the **Load Image** node bypassed (purple).\n- To animate a picture, select the **Load Image** node and press **Ctrl+B** to enable it, then load your image.\n- Change the prompt in **CLIP Text Encode (Positive Prompt)**.\n- This is the fast draft tier. Use **Wan 2.2 14B** for the final quality pass.\n- 704x1280 is the native 5B portrait size; keep it unless you know the model tolerates another size.\n"
      ],
      "title": "Shorts - how to use"
    },
